                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is similar to Moving Out but Moving Out was way better. The timer is very quick and trying to get three stars on any level is near impossible before the timer runs out. The movements of the characters make it impossible not to break the items you are to pack up. Half the time when you try to have the character use both hands they end up picking up two different items, rather than using two hands on one item. I feel the game is a bit buggy when trying to get the character to pick up an item I had to repeatedly  hit the pick up button before the character would actually pick up the item. \nBottom line if you want a good game in this genre get Moving Out it was way more fun and way less buggy. \nEven on sale this game ain't worth it. 3/10",
